Package: lion-greeter
Architecture: any-amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libpam0g (>= 1.5), systemd (>= 254)
Recommends: accountsservice, fprintd
Description: LionOS login backend (PAM auth, session launch)
 Privileged daemon implementing the LionOS spec 01 login backend: a
 SO_PEERCRED-gated JSON-lines UI socket for the unprivileged greeter UI,
 full PAM conversation support (password, expired-password change,
 multi-step prompts), logind session registration, clean-environment
 exec of lion-session, autologin / timed login, and tmpfs guest
 sessions. Secrets are zeroized after use and never logged or
 serialized.
